			<div class="content-center marquee-black" data-cid="tcm:182-360159-16" data-ctid="tcm:91-244424-32" >

				
				<div class="rsk-marquee-img-container">
					
						
							
	
		
			
			<picture>
				<source media="(min-width: 1080px)" srcset="https://www17.wellsfargomedia.com/assets/images/contextual/responsive/privacy-security/fraud/Security_Center_Couple_Banker_Marquee-1700x600.png?impolicy=SmCDesktopXL"/>
				<source media="(min-width: 570px)" srcset="https://www17.wellsfargomedia.com/assets/images/contextual/responsive/privacy-security/fraud/Security_Center_Couple_Banker_Marquee-1700x600.png?impolicy=SmCTabletM"/>
				<source media="(min-width: 0)" srcset="https://www17.wellsfargomedia.com/assets/images/contextual/responsive/privacy-security/fraud/Security_Center_Couple_Banker_Marquee-1700x600.png?impolicy=SmCMobileS" />
				<img src="https://www17.wellsfargomedia.com/assets/images/contextual/responsive/privacy-security/fraud/Security_Center_Couple_Banker_Marquee-1700x600.png" alt=""/>
				
			</picture>
		
	
	
	
	

						
						
					
				</div>

				<div class="rsk-marquee-content">
					<div class="rsk-marquee-inner-content">
						<h2>Making your banking security a priority</h2>
						
						<p>Vishing scams are on the rise. Learn how to protect yourself from fake or deceptive voice phone calls.</p>
						<a href="/privacy-security/fraud/bank-scams/" class="ps-btn-primary" data-cid="tcm:182-360159-16" data-ctid="tcm:91-244424-32" data-presentation="1">Read more</a>

					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>

	
		
	<div class="card-background-white text-aligned-center">
		
		
		
		<div class="card-container three-card card-left card-theme2" data-cid="tcm:84-360165-16" data-ctid="tcm:91-223650-32">
			
				

	<div class="enhanced-txt-cm text-aligned-left" data-cid="tcm:84-360162-16" data-ctid="tcm:91-223644-32">

		<div>
			<div><img src="https://www17.wellsfargomedia.com/assets/images/contextual/responsive/privacy-security/fraud/Security_Center_Wells_Fargo_Phone_ATM_Woman-616x353.png" alt=""/></div>
			<div class="enhanced-txt-body">

				<div class="title2-SemiBold">How Wells Fargo protects you</div>

				

				<div class="subheadline-regular" >From zero-liability protection<sup class="c20ref" data-footnote="tcm:84-360184-16" type="footnote"></sup> to 24/7 fraud monitoring, Wells Fargo helps keep your accounts and information safe.</div>

				

				

				

				

				

				<p><a href="/privacy-security/fraud/protecting-you/" class="ps-btn-secondary" data-cid="tcm:84-360162-16" data-ctid="tcm:91-223644-32" data-presentation="2">Explore Wells Fargo security</a></p>

			</div>
		</div>
	</div>

			
				

	<div class="enhanced-txt-cm text-aligned-left" data-cid="tcm:84-360163-16" data-ctid="tcm:91-223644-32">

		<div>
			<div><img src="https://www17.wellsfargomedia.com/assets/images/contextual/responsive/privacy-security/fraud/Security_Center_Pencil_Checkboxes-616x353.png" alt=""/></div>
			<div class="enhanced-txt-body">

				<div class="title2-SemiBold">Take charge of your security</div>

				

				<div class="subheadline-regular" >Whether you’re an individual customer or a corporate client, simple actions can help you stay informed and avoid scams.</div>

				

				

				

				

				

				<p><a href="/privacy-security/fraud/protect-yourself" class="ps-btn-secondary" data-cid="tcm:84-360163-16" data-ctid="tcm:91-223644-32" data-presentation="2">Learn more</a></p>

			</div>
		</div>
	</div>

			
				

	<div class="enhanced-txt-cm text-aligned-left" data-cid="tcm:84-360164-16" data-ctid="tcm:91-223644-32">

		<div>
			<div><img src="https://www17.wellsfargomedia.com/assets/images/contextual/responsive/privacy-security/fraud/Security_Center_Phone_Hands-616x353.png" alt=""/></div>
			<div class="enhanced-txt-body">

				<div class="title2-SemiBold">Report fraud or suspicious activity</div>

				

				<div class="subheadline-regular" >If you notice unauthorized or suspicious activity related to your Wells Fargo accounts, report it to us immediately.</div>

				

				

				

				

				

				<p><a href="/privacy-security/fraud/report/" class="ps-btn-secondary" data-cid="tcm:84-360164-16" data-ctid="tcm:91-223644-32" data-presentation="2">Contact Wells Fargo</a></p>

			</div>
		</div>
	</div>

			
		</div>
		
	</div>

	
		
    

        <div class="ps-body-title-wrapper align-center" test-id="ps-body-title-wrapper-id">
            <div class="ps-body-title-top-line"></div>

            <div class="ps-body-title"
                test-id="ps-body-title"><h2  >Security and fraud FAQs</h2></div>

            
        </div>
    

	
		
    
    
    
    <details class="show-hide-content-wrapper" data-cid="tcm:182-360166-16" data-ctid="tcm:91-244416-32" open="open">
        
        <summary class="show-hide-content-title" aria-expanded="true" role="button">
			<span class="show-hide-title-text">
				<span class="hidden">What should I do if I see a transaction I didn’t authorize?</span>     
				<a href = "#WhatshouldIdoifIseeatransactionIdidntauthorize?" aria-hidden = "true" tabindex = "-1">What should I do if I see a transaction I didn’t authorize?</a>			 
			</span>	
        </summary>
        
        <div class="show-hide-content-text-wrapper-collapsible">Report it immediately. Visit the Wells Fargo <a href="/privacy-security/fraud/report/">Report fraud or suspicious activity</a> page for guidance. The faster you report the issue, the sooner we can help you protect your account.</div>
    </details>

	
		
    
    
    
    <details class="show-hide-content-wrapper" data-cid="tcm:182-360167-16" data-ctid="tcm:91-244416-32">
        
        <summary class="show-hide-content-title" aria-expanded="false" role="button">
			<span class="show-hide-title-text">
				<span class="hidden">How do I know if an email, text, or call is really from Wells Fargo?</span>     
				<a href = "#HowdoIknowifanemailtextorcallisreallyfromWellsFargo?" aria-hidden = "true" tabindex = "-1">How do I know if an email, text, or call is really from Wells Fargo?</a>			 
			</span>	
        </summary>
        
        <div class="show-hide-content-text-wrapper-collapsible">Scammers may pretend to be Wells Fargo and use urgent messages to pressure you. Don’t respond. Contact Wells Fargo directly if you are unsure. Learn how to recognize <a href="/privacy-security/fraud/bank-scams/bank-imposter/">bank imposter scams</a> and other <a href="/privacy-security/fraud/bank-scams/">common threats and scams</a>.</div>
    </details>

	
		
    
    
    
    <details class="show-hide-content-wrapper" data-cid="tcm:182-360168-16" data-ctid="tcm:91-244416-32">
        
        <summary class="show-hide-content-title" aria-expanded="false" role="button">
			<span class="show-hide-title-text">
				<span class="hidden">What are some common red flags I should watch out for to avoid a scam?</span>     
				<a href = "#WhataresomecommonredflagsIshouldwatchoutfortoavoidascam?" aria-hidden = "true" tabindex = "-1">What are some common red flags I should watch out for to avoid a scam?</a>			 
			</span>	
        </summary>
        
        <div class="show-hide-content-text-wrapper-collapsible">Scams often involve urgent messages, unexpected contact, emotional pressure, or unusual payment requests like gift cards, crypto, wire transfers, or large in-branch withdrawal requests. Visit <a href="/privacy-security/fraud/bank-scams/">common bank and money scams</a> for more info.</div>
    </details>

	
		
    
    
    
    <details class="show-hide-content-wrapper" data-cid="tcm:182-360171-16" data-ctid="tcm:91-244416-32">
        
        <summary class="show-hide-content-title" aria-expanded="false" role="button">
			<span class="show-hide-title-text">
				<span class="hidden">What should I do if I suspect fraud or a scam targeting an older adult?</span>     
				<a href = "#WhatshouldIdoifIsuspectfraudorascamtargetinganolderadult?" aria-hidden = "true" tabindex = "-1">What should I do if I suspect fraud or a scam targeting an older adult?</a>			 
			</span>	
        </summary>
        
        <div class="show-hide-content-text-wrapper-collapsible">If the issue is related to a Wells Fargo account, call us at <span class="c12">1-800-869-3557</span> for assistance. Visit <a href="/privacy-security/fraud/bank-scams/elder-financial-scams/">Tips to avoid scams targeting elder adults</a> for more information.</div>
    </details>

	
		
    
    
    
    <details class="show-hide-content-wrapper" data-cid="tcm:182-360172-16" data-ctid="tcm:91-244416-32">
        
        <summary class="show-hide-content-title" aria-expanded="false" role="button">
			<span class="show-hide-title-text">
				<span class="hidden">How do I protect my devices and online banking accounts?</span>     
				<a href = "#HowdoIprotectmydevicesandonlinebankingaccounts?" aria-hidden = "true" tabindex = "-1">How do I protect my devices and online banking accounts?</a>			 
			</span>	
        </summary>
        
        <div class="show-hide-content-text-wrapper-collapsible">Use Wells Fargo’s security guides (for <a href="/privacy-security/fraud/security-tools-and-options/">individuals</a>, for <a href="/privacy-security/fraud/resources-for-businesses">businesses</a>,  and for <a href="/privacy-security/fraud/resources-for-commercial-and-corporate-clients">commercial and corporate clients</a>) for device and account protection best practices.</div>
    </details>

	
		
	<div class="card-background-white text-aligned-center">
		
		
		
		<div class="card-container three-card card-left card-theme4" data-cid="tcm:84-360182-16" data-ctid="tcm:91-223650-32">
			
				

